## Lab 2 — Active Directory User Administration

**Objective:** Manage domain user accounts using Samba AD tools.

**Commands:**
```bash
sudo samba-tool user list
sudo samba-tool user create testuser
sudo samba-tool user disable testuser
sudo samba-tool user show testuser
sudo samba-tool user enable testuser
```

**Results:**
- Listed existing domain users.
- Created testuser.
- Disabled testuser.
- Verified userAccountControl value 514.
- Re-enabled testuser.
- Verified userAccountControl value 512.

**Skills Demonstrated:** Domain account creation, account administration, and account status verification.

---

## Lab 3 — Windows Group Policy

**Objective:** Configure local Windows security policies.

**Tool:** Local Group Policy Editor (gpedit.msc)

**Settings Configured:**
- Minimum password length: 10 characters.
- Password complexity: Enabled.
- Maximum password age: 90 days.

**Command:**
```powershell
gpupdate /force
```

**Results:**
- User Policy update completed.
- Computer Policy update encountered an error.
- Local password policy settings were configured.

**Note:** These were local Windows policies, not domain-wide Group Policy settings.

**Skills Demonstrated:** Local security policy configuration and Group Policy troubleshooting.

